Mix components and autoclave under a N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (80:20, v/v) gas mixture. After cooling, aseptically and anaerobically, add the following solutions from anaerobic stocks (autoclaved and stored under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere):   <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1 M NaHCO<sub>3</sub> solution                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
